 "post": {
  "instagram": "A simple trend-following system in 4 steps: 1) mark the 20-day high, 2) buy a close above it, 3) stop at the 10-day low, 4) exit on a close below the 10-day low. Example: entry 103.56, stop 100.76, exit 109.24, about 2.0R. It loses often in sideways markets; a few big trends tend to pay for the rest.\n\nSave this for later and follow @calmedgeofficial for one trading concept a day.\n\nEducational example on an illustrative chart. Not financial advice; trading involves risk of loss.\n\n#trendfollowing #breakouttrading #swingtrading #tradingeducation #technicalanalysis #daytrading #trading #learntotrade",
